<p></p>', 'EXCERPT: Even when things were difficult during the Ebola outbreak the club did not disintegrate; it hibernated.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Bureh-Beach-Surf-Club-FB-BRILL.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"community","title":"Community"},{"slug":"development-work","title":"Development Work"}]', '[{"slug":"sierra-leone","title":"Sierra Leone"},{"slug":"simon-cumbers-media-fund","title":"Simon Cumbers Media Fund"}]', '', 117, 1, '2017-06-26T18:56:00Z', '2023-12-15T01:19:46Z', '2017-06-26T18:56:00Z')
